    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap RC Stick Exponential (Expo) &amp; Deadband Curve Mapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides stick input response shaping for drones/RC models:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Deadband filtering: Ignores micro-stick jitter around neutral center (1500 us +/- deadband).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exponential curve: y = (1 - expo) * x + expo * x^3 (softens center stick precision).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Dual Rate: Scales output range (0..100%).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All operations use Q16.16 fixed-point arithmetic. Zero float / zero heap. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
